sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Spark Webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as SparkApplication<br/>Controller
    participant SchedCtrl as ScheduledSparkApp<br/>Controller
    participant Driver as Driver Pod
    participant Executors as Executor Pods

    Note over User,Executors: SparkApplication Submission Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply SparkApplication CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>443/TCP TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated SparkApplication (defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>443/TCP TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: GET ResourceQuotas<br/>Check resource limits
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: SparkApplication created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Service<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap (monitoring)<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodDisruptionBudget (if enabled)<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    K8sAPI-->>Driver: Driver Pod scheduled
    Driver->>K8sAPI: Request Executor Pods
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate--v1-pod<br/>443/TCP TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Pod (Spark labels/env injected)
    K8sAPI-->>Executors: Executor Pods scheduled

    Executors-->>Driver: Task results
    Driver-->>K8sAPI: Update SparkApplication status

    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: Pod completed
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update SparkApplication status<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Cleanup executor pods<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    Note over User,Executors: ScheduledSparkApplication Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ScheduledSparkApplication CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-...-scheduledsparkapplication<br/>443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-...-scheduledsparkapplication<br/>443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    K8sAPI-->>SchedCtrl: Watch event: ScheduledSparkApp created

    loop Cron Schedule
        SchedCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create SparkApplication CR<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
        Note right of SchedCtrl: Triggers SparkApplication flow above
    end
